                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "GAP MATRIX  Month × Region × Channel × Category. Drill month to Region to Channel to Category; signed gaps net together. Never interpret at Customer level.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#374151"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "PRODUCT MATRIX  Category to Brand to SKU. Compare sales, units, ASP, discount, and margin; patterns are descriptive, not proof of causality.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#374151"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "CUSTOMER CONTRIBUTION  Customer / Outlet grain; read observed sales within the selected period and filters.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#374151"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "CORE HIGH DECLINE TABLE  Customer / Outlet as of Sep-2026; review relative risk and T12M base. Exposure is not predicted loss.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12px",
                      "color": "#374151"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "POTENTIAL TABLE  Customer / Outlet as of Sep-2026; validate relative Momentum / Engagement, assortment/frequency, and capacity. T12M base is not incremental opportunity.",
